/// seealso:
/// <code>getSharedTrack(with:completion:)</code>
/// \param token The public track token that identifies the track to update.
///
/// \param shared <code>true</code> to make the track shared/public; <code>false</code> to make it private/unshared.
///
/// \param completion A closure invoked when the request finishes.
