/// <code>startTrackAsPersistent()</code>, <code>stopTracking()</code> forcibly switches <code>trackingMode</code> back to <code>.standard</code>.
/// important:
/// You must call <code>startTrackAsPersistent()</code> on the Main Thread.
/// seealso:
/// <code>setTrackingMode(_:)</code>, <code>startTracking()</code>, <code>stopTracking()</code>, <code>getDeviceId()</code>
