/// seealso:
/// <code>setMaxPersistentTrackingInterval(minutes:)</code>, <code>startPersistentTracking()</code>, <code>stopTracking()</code>
///
/// returns:
/// An <code>Int</code> representing the maximum persistent tracking interval in minutes.
