/// Sets the tracking mode used by the SDK for both automatically and manual started tracking sessions.
/// Use this method to define whether tracking sessions started by SDK triggers
/// such as motion or location activity should run in <code>.standard</code> or <code>.persistent</code>
/// mode. Persistent tracking continues operating in the background and across app
/// launches until explicitly stopped or until the maximum persistent tracking
/// interval is reached.
/// important:
/// Using <code>.persistent</code> may increase battery usage and background
/// activity. Ensure your app is configured with the required location
/// permissions, background modes, and usage descriptions.
/// seealso:
/// <code>getTrackingMode()</code>,  <code>setMaxPersistentTrackingInterval(minutes:)</code>
