/// Call this method to prompt the user to grant permission for motion and fitness activity tracking,
/// which is necessary for the SDK to access motion data (such as steps, activity types, or motion events)
/// from the device sensors. Motion permission is required for accurate trip detection, driving behavior analysis,
/// and related telematics features that use accelerometer or gyroscope data.
/// important:
