/// This method should be called from your app delegate’s
/// <code>application(_:performFetchWithCompletionHandler:)</code> implementation.
/// It allows the TelematicsSDK to perform background tasks such as sending
/// a heartbeat or processing pending data uploads when the system grants
/// background execution time.
/// important:
/// If tracking is active, the completion handler is called
/// immediately. Otherwise, a heartbeat is sent and the handler is invoked
/// after a short delay.
/// note:
/// If no valid device id exists, this method returns
