/// This is the legacy form of <code>setAutoStartEnabled(_:)</code> with the inverted meaning:
/// <code>setDisableTracking(disableTracking: true)</code> is equivalent to
/// <code>setAutoStartEnabled(false)</code> plus <code>stopTracking()</code>.
